nowledge base, books appointments through the Joober API, and transfers to a person when needed.","how":"Each call is answered instantly. The agent qualifies the customer, checks the knowledge base for common issues, books an appointment straight into Joober, and transfers to a human when the situation calls for it.","flow":[{"label":"Incoming Call","note":"Answered at any hour"},{"label":"AI Voice Agent","note":"Troubleshoots from a knowledge base"},{"label":"Customer Qualification","note":"Captures details and urgency"},{"label":"Joober Appointment Booking","note":"Booked via the Joober API"},{"label":"Human Handoff When Needed","note":"Transfers to staff"}],"stack":["VAPI","GPT-4","Python FastAPI","Joober API"],"outcomes":["No missed calls or lost leads outside office hours","Appointments land directly in the scheduling system, with no re-entry","Staff stay on jobs instead of answering the phone","Coverage around the clock without hiring extra call handlers"],"results":[{"value":"0","label":"missed calls after hours"},{"value":"24/7","label":"call handling"},{"value":"3 weeks","label":"to deploy"},{"value":"100%","label":"calls captured and logged"}],"visual":"call","wide":true,"featured":true},"featured":true,"className":"lg:col-span-7"}],["$","$L5","voice-ai-insurance",{"project":{"slug":"voice-ai-insurance","title":"Voice AI Solutions for Insurance Businesses","featuredTitle":"AI Voice Agents for Insurance & Law Firms","category":"Voice AI","industry":"Insurance","summary":"Voice agents that handle inbound calls and capture caller details for insurance teams.","problem":"Insurance teams field a steady stream of routine calls that pull staff away from complex work.","built":"Voice agents that answer calls, collect the information a team needs, and route to the right person.","how":"The agent answers, gathers caller details, and passes the conversation to staff with the information already captured.","flow":[{"label":"Incoming Call"},{"label":"AI Voice Agent"},{"label":"Caller Details Captured"},{"label":"Routed to Staff"}],"outcomes":["Callers get answered instead of waiting","Staff receive calls with details already captured"],"visual":"call","featured":true},"featured":true,"className":"lg:col-span-5"}],["$","$L5","ai-sales-agent-platform",{"project":{"slug":"ai-sales-agent-platform","title":"AI Sales Agent Platform","category":"AI Agents","summary":"An agent platform that sources leads, drafts personalised outreach and keeps the pipeline organised.","problem":"Prospecting and outreach are repetitive and hard to keep consistent by hand.","built":"A platform connecting Apollo lead data, GPT-4o drafting, n8n orchestration and an Airtable pipeline.","how":"n8n pulls leads from Apollo, GPT-4o prepares the outreach, and results are stored in Airtable.","flow":[{"label":"Leads","note":"Apollo"},{"label":"Orchestration","note":"n8n"},{"label":"Personalised Outreach","note":"GPT-4o"},{"label":"Pipeline Records","note":"Airtable"}],"stack":["Apollo","GPT-4o","n8n","Airtable"],"outcomes":["Less manual prospecting work","One organised view of the pipeline"],"visual":"agent","featured":true},"featured":true,"className":"lg:col-span-5"}],["$","$L5","rag-document-intelligence",{"project":{"slug":"rag-document-intelligence","title":"RAG Document Intelligence System","category":"RAG & Intelligence","summary":"Ask questions of your own documents and get answers grounded in the source material.","problem":"Knowledge locked inside documents is slow to search and easy to miss.","built":"A retrieval-augmented system built with LangChain, Pinecone and Groq, with a Next.js interface.","how":"Documents are indexed in Pinecone. Questions retrieve the relevant passages, and the model answers from them.","flow":[{"label":"Documents Uploaded"},{"label":"Indexed","note":"Pinecone"},{"label":"Retrieval","note":"LangChain"},{"label":"Answer","note":"Groq"}],"stack":["LangChain","Pinecone","Groq","Next.js"],"outcomes":["Faster answers from your own do